{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"LEV","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"利未记","commonName":"利未记","title":"利未记","order":3,"numberOfChapters":27,"sha256":"abbbb926c1738f9da414cb45cd4d355517a03ac1f9d5f16d4bb017234cba6bbc","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/LEV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":27,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/LEV/27.json","totalNumberOfVerses":856},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["献燔祭的条例"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华在会幕里呼唤摩西，对他说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“你把以下条例告诉以色列人。 “如果你们有人献祭给耶和华，要用牛羊作祭物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["如果用牛作燔祭，必须用毫无残疾的公牛，在会幕门口献上，便可蒙耶和华悦纳。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["献祭者要把手放在燔祭牲的头上，所献的燔祭便蒙悦纳，为他赎罪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他要在耶和华面前宰牛，然后做祭司的亚伦子孙要把牛血洒在会幕门口的祭坛四周。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["献祭者要剥掉燔祭牲的皮，把它切成块。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["做祭司的亚伦子孙要在祭坛上生火，把木柴摆在火上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["然后将肉块、头和脂肪都摆在祭坛燃烧的木柴上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["献祭者要用水洗净牛的内脏和腿。祭司要把这一切都放在坛上焚烧。这是燔祭，是蒙耶和华悦纳的馨香火祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["“如果用绵羊或山羊作燔祭，必须用毫无残疾的公羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["献祭者要在祭坛北面，在耶和华面前宰羊。做祭司的亚伦子孙要把羊血洒在祭坛四周。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["献祭者将羊切成块后，祭司要把肉块、头和脂肪摆在祭坛燃烧的木柴上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["献祭者要用水洗净羊的内脏和腿。祭司要把这一切都放在坛上焚烧。这是燔祭，是蒙耶和华悦纳的馨香火祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["“如果有人用鸟作燔祭献给耶和华，要用斑鸠或雏鸽。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["祭司要把鸟带到祭坛前，拧下鸟头，放在祭坛上焚烧；要在祭坛旁放尽鸟血；"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["要除掉鸟的嗉子和羽毛，扔在祭坛东边倒灰的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["祭司要抓着两个翅膀把鸟撕开，但不可撕断，然后把鸟放在祭坛燃烧的木柴上焚烧。这是燔祭，是蒙耶和华悦纳的馨香火祭。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/LEV/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/LEV/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/40.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}